### Solve for $\maroonD{\ell}$



[[☃ image 1]]

$\begin{align}
\dfrac{\maroonD{\ell}}{\sqrt{901}} &= \dfrac{\blueE{700}}{\blueE{30}}
\\\\
\maroonD{\ell} &= \dfrac{700}{30} \cdot \sqrt{901}
\\\\
\maroonD{\ell} &\approx 700.4\,\text{cm}
\end{align}$

(rounded to the nearest tenth of a centimeter)
